  "body": "Each time we are about to pause for a user prompt, invoke the WebDriver BiDi User Prompt\nOpened algorithm, with the relevant Window, the type of the alert and the message text.\n\nWebDriver-BiDi changes are in https://github.com/w3c/webdriver-bidi/pull/195\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8010/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 17, 2022, 2:37 PM UTC (7009a10)\">/browsing-the-web.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8010/c3d7391...7009a10/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 17, 2022, 2:37 PM UTC (7009a10)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8010/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 17, 2022, 2:37 PM UTC (7009a10)\">/infrastructure.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8010/c3d7391...7009a10/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 17, 2022, 2:37 PM UTC (7009a10)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8010/timers-and-user-prompts.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 17, 2022, 2:37 PM UTC (7009a10)\">/timers-and-user-prompts.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8010/c3d7391...7009a10/timers-and-user-prompts.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 17, 2022, 2:37 PM UTC (7009a10)\">diff</a> )",
